{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよ٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！73回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nきょーへーさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのこのあいさつ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/05/8635622/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生まれて初めての体験をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、今度話しますが\nとても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう機会がなければ\n絶対やらないこと。ってあるじゃないですか(｡ρω-｡)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えばー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウニが嫌いだけど\nウニを食べなきゃいけない状況になり\n食べてみたら大丈夫だった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しそうで私にはできなさそう。。。と\n思っていた将棋を\n教えてもらいながらやると\nとても楽しくてはまってしまった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたの10時～ NHK Eテレで\nかりんのレギュラー番組\n将棋フォーカスさんに\nこの間の46時間テレビの将棋のところで\nインダビューがあり\nそのところが放送されます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、チェックしてみてください～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！それでね！\n話が戻るけど\n例えが少しわかりづらいし\n少し違うかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう経験したんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に言うと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プライベートとか\n自分だけなら\n絶対にやらないこと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！\nそういうことをしたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、できて良かったです！\n楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何個かやったんだけど\n最後のやつなんかは\n一番オススメで気に入ったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやくみなさんにも話したいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\n今日は絢音ちゃんのお誕生日！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音の笑うツボが人とは違って\nそれをみてるのが楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度こそ！ご飯行こうねー(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/05/8635622/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/05/8635622/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/05/8635622/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t